 TABLET COUNT & WHOLESALE UNITS (MATCH vs REVIEW):\n27:    - \"match\": Exact same active drug brand, same strength, same dosage form.\n28:      CRITICAL RULE (STANDARD PACKS): If the requested shortage specifies a pack count (e.g. \"ديجستين 20قرص\", \"كيتولاك 5 امبوله\", \"كولونا 3شريط\", \"تادانيرفي 20فيلم\", \"ايفاستين 2 شريط\") and the warehouse candidate has the same drug, form, and strength but does not explicitly state the pack size (e.g. \"ديجستين اقراص/فاركو\", \"كيتولاك امبول/العامريه\", \"كولونا اقراص ٦٢ج\", \"تادانيرفي ٥ مجم سعر جديد\"):\n29:      THIS IS A 100% MATCH (\"status\": \"match\")! NEVER mark this as review!\n30:      CRITICAL RULE: If the numbers/counts are identical (even if written in Arabic numerals ٣ vs 3) or the only difference is the manufacturer name (/نوفارتس, /اكاديميا, /ايبيكو), THIS IS A 100% MATCH. NEVER mark as review!\n31:    - \"review\": ONLY mark review when there is an EXPLICIT, CONFLICTING number on BOTH sides (e.g. requested 15 tablets vs candidate explicitly writes 60 tablets, requested 24 tablets vs candidate explicitly writes 48 tablets).\n32:      In this case, return \"status\": \"review\" AND provide a clear Arabic explanation in \"reason\" (e.g. \"اختلاف عدد الأقراص: المطلوب 15 قرص والمرشح 60 قرص\").\n33: \n34: 4. TRADE BRAND vs GENERIC / ALTERNATIVE (بديل أو مثيل):\n35:    - \"match\": Both items must have the SAME commercial trade brand name (e.g. Panadol matching Panadol, Zovirax matching Zovirax).\n36:    - \"review\": If the candidate has the SAME active ingredient and SAME strength, but is a generic name or a DIFFERENT trade brand (e.g. requested trade brand \"رو اكيتان 20\" vs candidate generic \"ايزوتريتينوين 20\", or requested \"زوفيراكس 400\" vs candidate \"لوفير 400\"):\n37:      DO NOT mark as \"match\"! Return \"status\": \"review\" AND explain in \"reason\":\n38:      \"بديل تجاري / مثيل: نفس المادة الفعالة والتركيز ولكن الاسم التجاري مختلف (المطلوب: [اسم]، المتوفر: [اسم])\".\n39: \n40: 5. WHOLESALE & 